<title>BELGIUM: QUOTE OF THE WEEK: DAVIGNON ON MERGERS AND GOD.</title>
<headline>QUOTE OF THE WEEK: DAVIGNON ON MERGERS AND GOD.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Societe Generale de Belgique Chairman Etienne Davignon made the following comment on Tuesday in response to a question about the possibility of a link between France's Cie. de Suez and Lyonnaise des Eaux.</p>
<p>&quot;(A merger) is still something maybe God and the Holy Spirit are aware of, but I have been trying to contact them on the Internet and am not getting many answers at the moment.&quot;</p>
<p>Davignon was speaking at a news conference on SGB's 1996 results.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
